<title>UK: LME - warehouse stock movements.</title>
<headline>LME - warehouse stock movements.</headline>
<text>
<p>LONDON, Jun 18 - Latest LME warehouse stock changes are: copper up 300, tin down 250, lead down 50, zinc down 725, aluminium down 3100, nickel up 306, aluminium alloy down 60</p>
